WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.755
This module is about more than display formatting A
trailing space can

00:00:05.781 --> 00:00:11.797
create a different category Inconsistent case can
fragment groups A

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:17.477
date stored as text cannot safely participate in
date arithmetic Time

00:00:17.504 --> 00:00:23.362
values also have different meanings A calendar date
is different from a local clock timestamp

00:00:23.611 --> 00:00:29.025
and both are different from an instant stored with
time-zone meaning The goal is to

00:00:29.038 --> 00:00:32.394
prepare these values without accidentally changing
what they mean
